x_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3 </span>Method</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S3.SS1\" title=\"In 3 Method ‣ Learning Music Style for Piano Arrangement Through Cross-Modal Bootstrapping\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3.1 </span>Data Pairing for Style Learning</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S3.SS2\" title=\"In 3 Method ‣ Learning Music Style for Piano Arrangement Through Cross-Modal Bootstrapping\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3.2 </span>Q-Former Architecture</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S3.SS3\" title=\"In 3 Method ‣ Learning Music Style for Piano Arrangement Through Cross-Modal Bootstrapping\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3.3 </span>Stage-I: Audio-Symbolic Representation Learning</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S3.SS4\" title=\"In 3 Method ‣ Learning Music Style for Piano Arrangement Through Cross-Modal Bootstrapping\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">3.4 </span>Stage-II: Audio-to-Symbolic Generative Modeling</span></a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section\">\n<a href=\"#S4\" title=\"In Learning Music Style for Piano Arrangement Through Cross-Modal Bootstrapping\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">4 </span>Experiments</span></a>\n<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section\">\n<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#S4.SS1\" title=\"In 4 Experiments ‣ Learning Music Style for Piano Arrangement Through Cross-Modal Bootstrapping\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><spa